OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud across the region with isolated
OL,7,Flight showers mostly along the coast
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Turning dry for
OL,9,Fmost after midnight, and cool under
OL,10,Fclear skies. Generally light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FPartly cloudy and mostly dry
OL,13,Fto start. Cloud building at times
OL,14,Fthrough the day with isolated showers
OL,15,Fpossible mainly in the south. Breezy
OL,16,Fespecially around the coast. Near
OL,17,Faverage temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
