OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,7,Fcoming days, bringing partly cloudy
OL,8,Fconditions with occasional showers,
OL,9,Fand an easterly breeze. Temperatures
OL,10,Fremain around normal for the time of
OL,11,Fyear.
